{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--kubernetes-operator","name":"kubernetes-operator","description":"Use when building a Kubernetes Operator — custom controllers that reconcile CRD state. Triggers on \"build an operator\", \"CRD design\", \"reconcile loop\", \"controller-runtime\", \"kubebuilder\", \"operator-sdk\", \"metacontroller\", \"KOPF\", \"operator capability levels\", or \"custom resource\". Ships CRD validator, reconcile-loop linter, and OperatorHub capability auditor (all stdlib Python), 4 references on the operator pattern + CRD design + reconcile patterns + tooling landscape, and a /operator-audit slash command. NOT a generic k8s skill — specifically the Operator pattern.","category":"Design","tags":["kubernetes","operator","when","building","custom","controllers","reconcile","crd","state.","triggers","design","loop","controller","runtime","kubebuilder","sdk","metacontroller","kopf"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"engineering/kubernetes-operator/skills/kubernetes-operator","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/engineering/kubernetes-operator/skills/kubernetes-operator","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":11,"bytes":66404,"sha256":"b621796329b70f36d382319415cd837e1aa022937560cb7b8c7d7a0121ed31fc","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"engineering/kubernetes-operator/skills/kubernetes-operator/SKILL.md","bytes":11238,"sha256":"b621796329b70f36d382319415cd837e1aa022937560cb7b8c7d7a0121ed31fc","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/engineering/kubernetes-operator/skills/kubernetes-operator/SKILL.md"},{"path":"assets/crd_template.